,"lines":6,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"We built the Foundation Series because t","r":[224,755.22,616.58,157.5],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"We built the Foundation Series because the first barrier to participation in Egyptian capital markets is not money — it's conceptual. Most people don't have a clear mental model of what an exchange actually does, what a limit order is, or how to read a balance sheet. Five sessions won't make someone a professional analyst, but they'll give someone the vocabulary to start.","lines":6,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"We built the API because the second barr","r":[224,932.97,616.58,78.75],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"We built the API because the second barrier is data. Good analysis requires good data. The EFG API makes EGX market data available to anyone who wants to build on it.","lines":3,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"We built the showcase because the third ","r":[224,1031.97,616.58,105],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"We built the showcase because the third barrier is visibility. Brilliant work gets done by students and independent developers in Egypt every year. Most of it disappears. The showcase is a permanent record of that work.","lines":4,"tx":{"s":15,"f":"Anybody Variable","w":400,"lh":26.25,"ls":0,"c":{"r":0,"g":0,"b":0,"a":1},"a":"start","tt":"none","u":false,"v":"\"wdth\" 117, \"wght\" 348","dir":"ltr"}},{"t":"T","n":"None of this is altruism. An ecosystem w","r":[224,1157.22,616.58,78.75],"bg":null,"br":null,"bd":null,"str":"None of th